es yes i'm i'm retired now actually  camille made a comment because i i sent  her a picture one time the last week i  was in my brother's warehouse uh he  started a company ice shaker and i was  in the warehouse and i sent her a  picture of me in the warehouse and she's  like that's boring you should go back to  football  that's a lot more exciting and i was  like well what do you mean it's less  stress on me  i'm not i could i can't get injured in  this warehouse and uh it was just a  little joke and uh it was just funny at  the time but uh no i'm retired um i'm  like you now nate you know we're staying  retired and we're both on tv right now  together  but what if tom brady calls gronk you  know we just showed a video of you  crossing the touchdown crossing the goal  line i can't imagine what great feeling  that is what if tom brady called and  said i really need you again one more  time you you're telling us you'd really  say nope  well that was a cool video showing that  touchdown the super bowl that did get me  excited  no doubt about that but um  i i i would answer the phone call  obviously  [Laughter]  and  i i would you know talk to him chat with  him but i don't think i would go back to  football but uh i would definitely  answer the call  and uh  send them an eye shaker because that's  where i'm working now  okay all right all right i see what you  did there plug in the brand well listen  even if you don't go back you had one  hell of a career you are truly one of  the best of all time we appreciate you  joining us rob gronkowski you can watch  the usa today high school sports awards  this sunday on their website

